      <p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">写作边界说明</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 文中 &quot;no restart needed&quot;、&quot;history-safe injection, ongoing chat history is never remapped&quot;、账号池 429 冷却/故障转移/pin 长会话、<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">claude-ocx-&lt;provider&gt;--&lt;model&gt;</code> 别名、<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">localhost:10100</code>、<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">ocx init/start/claude/codex-shim</code> 等均为<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">官方 README 公开表述</strong>，非本文独立测评。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 未宣称 ocx 全面碾压 cc switch；对比仅限<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">形态与适用场景</strong>。cc switch 在中文圈存在多个同名/衍生项目，本文指&quot;配置切换类工具&quot;这一产品形态。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 安装与配置命令以官方文档为准；若上游改 flag，以仓库最新 README 覆盖本文。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• &quot;<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">--resume</code> 只能重建对话文本，重建不了活的进程状态&quot;为合理技术推断；如需严谨可自行验证。</li></ul><hr class="hr" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;"><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/G54UQVjjFicmZics0yUrPTuib04MkepoQmw3qRFMC6lRaGO8vKOia707JWaClAWbjrsSj1NuJ4micQJdHoo9whTD2iarjhCfegZrNiaQUy21cZQWnU/640?wx_fmt=png" data-local-path="/var/folders/gz/r3vdmpz51pvb70w6ybf9kdww0000gn/T/markdown-to-html-3DpqyW/remote_b069265b.png" alt="ziikoo" style="display: block; width: 100%; margin: 1.5em auto;"> 有话说</p><blockquote class="blockquote" style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0; font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;"><p class="p" style="display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">cc switch 切的是配置，一切就得清零重来；ocx 切的是路由，身体不动、只换脑——换脑不用搬家。</strong></p></blockquote><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">企业 AI 生产力管理平台 · ai.ziikoo.com</p>
    
  
    
  
    
